  "prefLabel": "He-P 3301.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3301.01 Purpose. These rules set forth the standards and requirements for the distribution of eligible foods from farmers to eligible recipients participating in the farmers’ market nutrition program (FMNP) as authorized by RSA 132:12-f, and in compliance with 7 CFR 248.\n\nSource. #14200, eff 2-26-25",
